cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BR-MANGUE Studio, please cite the release and its source repository."
title: "BR-MANGUE Studio"
type: software
version: 1.4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23509309
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Desktop research software for running and inspecting the BR-MANGUE spatial
  cellular model of mangrove response to coastal sea-level change. The Studio
  provides aligned raster inputs, explicit class mapping, custom class behavior
  profiles, continuous and persistent-block processing, annual outputs, visual
  monitoring, constant or calendar-based sea-level forcing, and reproducible run metadata.
